【Aji Review First Bullet】Poetic Soul: Shouting "poetic" full of meaning, carrying orders "soul flying away"?
On February 24, the price was 1866 for a short position, with a lowest price of 1795, floating profit of 71 points without taking profit and closing at breakeven;
On February 27, shorted at 2032, lowest at 1832, floating profit of 200 points without exiting, closed at breakeven;
On March 2, shorted at 1950, immediately hit stop loss to 2050 and closed at a loss;
On March 4, shorted at 1960, immediately hit stop loss to 2015 and closed at a loss;
Currently opening short position at 2100, lowest dropped to 1908, has rebounded;
🎈Advantages: The general direction of Poetic Soul is actually quite accurate, suitable for those who hold positions for a long time with wide stop losses, the emotional value provided in the live broadcast is also sufficient, suitable for those who take a big trend in one order, open one order a month, and earn several hundred points per order.
💣Disadvantages: It is obvious that he is the type of person who does not protect floating profits or take profits. Although there was a profit of 200 points in between, there was no intention to close the position, not willing to give up until reaching a certain price, which leads to breakeven or even loss on closure. Not suitable for short-term players or those with narrow stop losses, there are pros and cons without forced negativity~
Scoring section: 6.5/10 (full score ten), direction for improvement: the opening position is not good enough, often opening positions in the middle, not taking profits with gains, a profit of 200 points in ETH is also a considerable income, not flexibly trading, these orders are all short positions, although the price hasn't changed much, there was a fluctuation of nearly 1000 points in between, fans didn't get a bite~ Wishing you a better trading path in the future, bringing more returns to the fans~!!#ETH
